+ * fetch: `object` is the most one object may unpack to (bytes), `total` the most the whole pack may (bytes) and `produced`
+ * counts the bytes actually unpacked so far. Unset (the default) nothing is limited. A pack over a limit is stopped while it
+ * inflates (at most one 16 KiB chunk past the limit is ever produced) and throws an error whose `code` is 'UnpackLimitError'.
+ */
+const UNPACK_LIMITS = Symbol.for('creaton.isomorphic-git.unpackLimits');
